<img height="283" src="img/dino6_056_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/dino/dinotales6/img/dino6_056.jpg" --></a><a href="img/dino6_057.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/dino6_057_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/dino/dinotales6/img/dino6_057.jpg" --></a><a href="img/dino6_054.jpg"><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/dino/dinotales6/img/dino6_054.jpg" --></a><a href="img/dino6_055.jpg"><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/dino/dinotales6/img/dino6_055.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">色替え</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/dino6_054.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/dino6_054_small.jpg" width="378" /></a><a href="img/dino6_055.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/dino6_055_small.jpg" width="378" /></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">原型製作：菅谷　中<br />
<br />
<a href="../dinotales2">ダイノテイルズ2</a>以来の登場。このモデルはイグアノドンの中でもガッチリとした体格のイグアノドン・ベルニサールデンシス。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/dino6_058.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/dino6_058_small.jpg" width="378" /></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment"><a href="../dinotales2">ダイノテイルズ2</a>と比較。若干スリムに。前回の塗装は明るすぎですね。</td>
</tr>
